    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746620/extras/835751fadfeef9fcaa41f9ba67cf6555.poster.avif?t=1748164268\" width=650 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746620/extras/835751fadfeef9fcaa41f9ba67cf6555.webm?t=1748164268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SZ2000</strong> is a pixel-looks RPG game set in a  south town in the year of 2000. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play as a kid rabbit spending your 30 days summer holiday - hanging around the city and maintain a routine - you can explore the town, talk to townsfolk, strickly follow the daily code of conduct being a good rabbit? or\u00a0get some buzz, take dreamlike trips, push the boundaries to dig out what is behind a series disappearance - or just don\u2019t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore freely, die often, and enjoy the life being a little rabbit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >________________________________________</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seamless Open Map</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an seamless open city map, from greasy Cantonese diners to echoing underground parking lot,\u00a0 from your non-stop talking friend Qiqi to the street dealer Master Huang, every corner and character has a story, and a secret.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0Stomach &amp; Bladder System</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your little rabbit eats a <i>lot!</i> Daily life and bold adventures both take energy. Take good care of your bunny - don\u2019t let him go starving, and make sure there\u2019s a bathroom nearby when he overloads.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0Death Fragments</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Danger lurks everywhere in town, and your rabbit will probably die - many times:) But failure is just part of the fun. And who knows.. maybe you\u2019ll glimpse a deeper truth after death world in those parallels fragments?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0Time System</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time flows in SZ2000, just like the real world. Each day starts at the daycare or home, with 30 days to explore, rest well - adventure hard before the summer ends.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >________________________________________</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0Development:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In development.</strong><br>Add <strong>SZ2000</strong> to your <strong>Wishlist</strong>\u00a0to stay updated !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will also trying to update more devlogs about our process in story/arts/program, thank you for your support:)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746620/extras/8a76f081277a5d26ff9c97dce0962a99.poster.avif?t=1748164268\" width=120 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746620/extras/8a76f081277a5d26ff9c97dce0962a99.webm?t=1748164268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746620/extras/835751fadfeef9fcaa41f9ba67cf6555.poster.avif?t=1748164268\" width=650 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746620/extras/835751fadfeef9fcaa41f9ba67cf6555.webm?t=1748164268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SZ2000</strong> is a pixel-looks RPG game set in a  south town in the year of 2000. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play as a kid rabbit spending your 30 days summer holiday - hanging around the city and maintain a routine - you can explore the town, talk to townsfolk, strickly follow the daily code of conduct being a good rabbit? or\u00a0get some buzz, take dreamlike trips, push the boundaries to dig out what is behind a series disappearance - or just don\u2019t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore freely, die often, and enjoy the life being a little rabbit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >________________________________________</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seamless Open Map</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an seamless open city map, from greasy Cantonese diners to echoing underground parking lot,\u00a0 from your non-stop talking friend Qiqi to the street dealer Master Huang, every corner and character has a story, and a secret.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0Stomach &amp; Bladder System</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your little rabbit eats a <i>lot!</i> Daily life and bold adventures both take energy. Take good care of your bunny - don\u2019t let him go starving, and make sure there\u2019s a bathroom nearby when he overloads.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0Death Fragments</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Danger lurks everywhere in town, and your rabbit will probably die - many times:) But failure is just part of the fun. And who knows.. maybe you\u2019ll glimpse a deeper truth after death world in those parallels fragments?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0Time System</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time flows in SZ2000, just like the real world. Each day starts at the daycare or home, with 30 days to explore, rest well - adventure hard before the summer ends.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >________________________________________</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0Development:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In development.</strong><br>Add <strong>SZ2000</strong> to your <strong>Wishlist</strong>\u00a0to stay updated !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will also trying to update more devlogs about our process in story/arts/program, thank you for your support:)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746620/extras/8a76f081277a5d26ff9c97dce0962a99.poster.avif?t=1748164268\" width=120 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746620/extras/8a76f081277a5d26ff9c97dce0962a99.webm?t=1748164268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>",
